"Your fitting at %(boutique)s is booked for %(date)s at %(time)s. Manage your"
" appointment: %(link)s"
msgstr ""
"تم حجز موعدك في %(boutique)s يوم %(date)s الساعة %(time)s. لإدارة الموعد: "
